    "body": "Hey there, can you confirm that \"Zyachel\" is the full legal name you use to sign contracts? Unfortunately we cannot accept pseudonyms as signatures (see https://github.com/whatwg/sg/issues/93).\r\n\r\nIf \"Zyachel\" is not the legal name you use to sign contracts, you can send a PR to update https://github.com/whatwg/participant-data/blob/632a81587aac5138b5d13eca1a88400b99d96966/individuals.json#L4744 with the correct name.\r\n\r\nI know this is a lot of hassle for a typo fix; so sorry about that!",
